\vspace{0.4cm}

{\large\bfseries\color{CoverCream} 關於本書}\qquad{\baskervillefont\itshape\large\color{CoverGoldBright} About This Book}

\vspace{0.4cm}

\begin{minipage}{5in}
\small\color{CoverCream}
撒迦利亞書共十四章、二百一十一節。「萬軍之耶和華」出現五十三次，「在那日」二十二次。本書分十九個單元、四步逐段研讀全卷，以「啟示的次序」為骨幹，整合老弟兄的查經方法、加爾文、亨利、摩根、麥克阿瑟、E. B. Pusey 與幾位教父的注疏；中文經文採和合本，英文採 NASB 1995。每一句歸給注疏家的引文都附英文原文與出處行；核對方式與限制，見附錄〈引用出處總表〉。

\vspace{0.3cm}

{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream}\lettrine[lines=3,findent=2pt,nindent=2pt]{\color{CoverGoldBright}Z}{}echariah has fourteen chapters and 211 verses. The title “LORD of hosts” appears fifty-three times and “in that day” twenty-two times. This study reads the book in nineteen units and four movements, built on the order of revelation, with Elder Wong's way of reading Scripture and the commentary of John Calvin, Matthew Henry, G. Campbell Morgan, John MacArthur, E. B. Pusey and several church fathers, in the Chinese Union Version and the NASB 1995. Every quotation attributed to a commentator is given in its original English with a source a reader can check.}
\end{minipage}

\vspace{0.4cm}

{\small\bfseries\color{CoverCream} 四步：從回到錫安到歸耶和華為聖}\qquad{\baskervillefont\itshape\small\color{CoverGoldBright} Four Movements}

\vspace{0.3cm}

\begin{minipage}{4.7in}
\small\color{CoverCream}
\begin{tabular}{@{}cp{3.4in}l@{}}
第一步 & 神先回來 \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} The LORD returns first} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 1-6}\\[0.25em]
第二步 & 神先發問 \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} The question is turned back} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 7-8}\\[0.25em]
第三步 & 王來了，也被賣了 \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} The King comes, and is priced} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 9-11}\\[0.25em]
第四步 & 那日 \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} In that day} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 12-14}\\
\end{tabular}
\end{minipage}

